The Vector Watch project aimed to create a smartwatch that prioritized essential information and an extended battery life, offering a calmer interaction in a world of constant digital demands.

Andrei's work on Vector Watch, which ran from 2014 to 2017, involved developing a wearable platform that integrated hardware with a custom operating system and companion mobile applications for both iOS and Android. This allowed users to receive critical notifications and track activities while maintaining a month-long battery life.

Here is an image showcasing the Vector Watch Luna with its mobile companion app:
![Vector Watch Luna and mobile companion app](https://storage.googleapis.com/framdesign-assets/assets/vector/vector-watch-luna.jpeg?GoogleAccessId=vertex-express%40fram-design-website.iam.gserviceaccount.com&Expires=1770364664&Signature=C%2Fs6LFHIR2GPXYoZCnthHD4BJvAVI80j48tl%2F0fh%2FMQvsANz4PkAiepJXD3jekUxyVM5di%2Bvy6bu0mIPjAKM%2BrI7GwAOuW74S9TD%2Fr3cWFE38pZPdNLRTiFwP8YgIJhUxzTZNTlYt98yjTtoEkXHRqm00cRNdo%2FMoyO06yE7IjBoiA0aYQaFAx7%2Bn6LpKnFUabwoMdLtIgHZw7phLfcBnnfopR8TfcvNXDdxOoROWA4%2FLWETpo4Q6gl4Q%2Bc%2FRI0KJw9fUrFpGQ33uYG6z6qfjYIrs0cyHi1aIYxGymXfqeDk4f1raFwL47kW6rRNhsaGZ8mcxqZN%2FNalX1S%2FClHcSg%3D%3D)

